  <ModelIncludes "CD4052.cir.lst">
  <Spice>
* CD4052B CMOS Differential 4-Channel Analog Multiplexer/Demultiplexer
* XSPICE logic, transistor level CMOS transmission gates.
* Logic thresholds and gate drive follow the supply pins.
* Pins 1..16 as in the DIP-16 package
.SUBCKT CD4052B y0 y2 ycom y3 y1 inh vee vss b a x3 x0 xcom x1 x2 vdd
XINA a da vdd vss CD405X_IN
ANA da dna inv1
XINB b db vdd vss CD405X_IN
ANB db dnb inv1
XININH inh dinh vdd vss CD405X_IN
ANINH dinh dninh inv1
* channel is on when its address matches and INH is low
AX0 [dna dnb dninh] ex0 and1
AX1 [da dnb dninh] ex1 and1
AX2 [dna db dninh] ex2 and1
AX3 [da db dninh] ex3 and1
AY0 [dna dnb dninh] ey0 and1
AY1 [da dnb dninh] ey1 and1
AY2 [dna db dninh] ey2 and1
AY3 [da db dninh] ey3 and1
AOUT [ex0 ex1 ex2 ex3 ey0 ey1 ey2 ey3] [sx0 sx1 sx2 sx3 sy0 sy1 sy2 sy3] dac1
XSX0 x0 xcom sx0 vdd vee CD405X_SW
XSX1 x1 xcom sx1 vdd vee CD405X_SW
XSX2 x2 xcom sx2 vdd vee CD405X_SW
XSX3 x3 xcom sx3 vdd vee CD405X_SW
XSY0 y0 ycom sy0 vdd vee CD405X_SW
XSY1 y1 ycom sy1 vdd vee CD405X_SW
XSY2 y2 ycom sy2 vdd vee CD405X_SW
XSY3 y3 ycom sy3 vdd vee CD405X_SW
RQ vdd vss 1e9
